<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | RoamDawn" description="RoamDawn privacy information covering cookies, analytics, advertising, forms, newsletter services and user rights."><section class="container max-w-4xl py-14 prose"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated: August 23, 2026</strong></p><p>This policy should be reviewed and adapted to the services actually enabled on RoamDawn and to the laws applicable to the site operator.</p><h2>Information we may receive</h2><p>We may receive information you voluntarily submit through contact or newsletter forms. Hosting and security systems may also process standard technical information such as IP address, request time and browser details.</p><h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>Essential local storage may remember privacy preferences. Optional analytics or advertising should only run when properly configured and, where legally required, after consent.</p><h2>Advertising and analytics</h2><p>If Google AdSense or analytics services are enabled, the actual providers, identifiers, purposes and retention practices should be documented here before launch.</p><h2>Third parties</h2><p>Newsletter, analytics, advertising and form providers may process information under their own policies. Review their current terms before enabling them.</p><h2>User rights</h2><p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights concerning access, correction, deletion, objection or restriction. Contact RoamDawn to make a request.</p><h2>International visitors</h2><p>Readers outside the site operator's country may have additional rights under local privacy laws, including GDPR where applicable.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Use our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for privacy questions.</p></section></BaseLayout>